16. TLS termination

            Clients communicate securely:  HTTPS
            
            The gateway can terminate TLS:            
                                    Client
                                      |
                                     HTTPS
                                      |
                                      v
                                    Gateway
                                      |
                                      | internal secure channel
                                      v
                                    Backend
            
            This centralizes certificate management.            
            But at high-security boundaries, you may also use mTLS between services.            
            The gateway shouldn't become the only security layer.



